The roughly trapezoidal plot has approximately 16 metres of northern road frontage and a maximum depth of approximately 25.5 metres. SAM''s registered acquisition describes two three-storey shophouses. Khiri Nakhon Road is described as public, with approximately 16 metres of concrete carriageway and a 20-metre right of way.

SAM reports red planning zoning, residential and commercial surroundings and convenient transport. The listed nearby place is Chonburi Technology College. Confirm permitted building use and any operating licences for the intended activity.

From Bangkok toward Nong Mon on Sukhumvit Road (Highway 3), turn left at Khiri junction into Khiri Nakhon Road for approximately 400 metres; the property is on the right.

Images show the front and side elevations, ground-floor halls, upper-floor space, stairs and a bathroom. Some exterior photos display 1 September 2022; another exterior view and interiors display 12 March 2023. Inspect current floors, walls, ceilings, roof, electrical and plumbing systems.

SAM showed direct-purchase status and this price on 11 September 2026. Contact 02-686-1888, sales@sam.or.th or LINE @samline, quoting 3A1647, to confirm availability, price, viewing and terms.

